# tools/verify_seed.py checks seeded files byte-for-byte against SEED_MANIFEST.json
# and task_manifest.json. Store and check them out verbatim, independent of a
# host's core.autocrlf, so the integrity check passes on every fresh clone.
/AI_Engineering_*        -text
/README.md               -text
/CLAUDE.md               -text
/OVERSEER_START.md       -text
/SEED_MANIFEST.json      -text
/task_manifest.json      -text
/.gitignore              -text
/task_prompts/**         -text
/tools/verify_seed.py    -text
